; Draws one of each basic entity, hatches and dimensions them, then drives a dimension.
; Run: starcad --script tests/draw_basics.scr
LINE
10,10
100,10
100,60
C
10,10
REC
120,10
200,60
CIRCLE
250,35
25
POLYGON
6
330,35
I
25
ELLIPSE
C
400,35
440,35
15
