Hello StarCAD
Second line of text

MTEXT
250,230
400,170
Multiline text wraps inside its box width.\PSecond paragraph.
; Hatch inside the rectangle and inside the line triangle
HATCH
!click 160,35
!click 70,20

; Hatch the circle with a solid fill by selecting it
HATCH
Pattern
Solid
Select objects
!click 275,35


; Associative dimensions (clicked so object snaps capture references)
DIMLINEAR
!click 120,10
!click 200,10
!click 160,-5
DIMLINEAR
!click 200,10
!click 200,60
!click 215,35
DIMALIGNED
!click 100,10
!click 100,60
!click 110,35
DIMRADIUS
!click 275,35
!click 290,70
DIMDIAMETER
!click 50,140
!click 70,160
ZOOM
E
!move 330,120
!wait 2
!screenshot tests/out_basics.bmp
!wait 2
; Drive the rectangle width 80 -> 120 (stretch) and the circle radius 25 -> 15
!dimvalue 160,-5 120
!dimvalue 290,70 15
ZOOM
E
!wait 2
!screenshot tests/out_driven.bmp
!wait 2
!exit
